    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >9Cat is a free-to-play isometric co-op shooter, but with cute cats and a vast variant of gears and cats that completely alter your playstyles..</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You will wander in the ever-changing landscapes to scavenge resources and shoot your way out of trouble.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687040/extras/296a2d176fdbfd3882a56de5c16ca2c8.poster.avif?t=1738749463\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687040/extras/296a2d176fdbfd3882a56de5c16ca2c8.webm?t=1738749463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687040/extras/296a2d176fdbfd3882a56de5c16ca2c8.mp4?t=1738749463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit more 9Cats, collect more gears, gather your friends to form a squad of up to 4 kittens and defeat bosses\u2026 but we warned, it will require much more than shooting.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687040/extras/ecfba55ec65057273a8f676e255e04b6.poster.avif?t=1738749463\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687040/extras/ecfba55ec65057273a8f676e255e04b6.webm?t=1738749463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687040/extras/ecfba55ec65057273a8f676e255e04b6.mp4?t=1738749463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How will you raise your 9Cat? A mighty warrior, a geeky technician or a spell weiding wizard? Let\u2019s find out in 9Cat Saga.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687040/extras/f7f5e5290511f63c65d0c878a7a8bec1.avif?t=1738749463\" width=626 height=312 /></span></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >9Cat is a free-to-play isometric co-op shooter, but with cute cats and a vast variant of gears and cats that completely alter your playstyles..</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You will wander in the ever-changing landscapes to scavenge resources and shoot your way out of trouble.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687040/extras/296a2d176fdbfd3882a56de5c16ca2c8.poster.avif?t=1738749463\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687040/extras/296a2d176fdbfd3882a56de5c16ca2c8.webm?t=1738749463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687040/extras/296a2d176fdbfd3882a56de5c16ca2c8.mp4?t=1738749463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit more 9Cats, collect more gears, gather your friends to form a squad of up to 4 kittens and defeat bosses\u2026 but we warned, it will require much more than shooting.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687040/extras/ecfba55ec65057273a8f676e255e04b6.poster.avif?t=1738749463\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687040/extras/ecfba55ec65057273a8f676e255e04b6.webm?t=1738749463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687040/extras/ecfba55ec65057273a8f676e255e04b6.mp4?t=1738749463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How will you raise your 9Cat? A mighty warrior, a geeky technician or a spell weiding wizard? Let\u2019s find out in 9Cat Saga.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst